      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Simulation rate",
      "description": "Server tick rate. Palworld and Satisfactory only -- mc-monitor speaks server-list ping and cannot see inside the server. This does NOT drop when Satisfactory auto-pauses: measured over 151 idle scrapes it held 25.8-29.0 fps while gameserver_uptime_seconds sat perfectly flat. A FLAT line here is therefore a stuck process, not an idle server -- read it next to the Paused panel.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
