      "title": "Paused (auto-pause)",
      "description": "Satisfactory only -- it runs with AUTOPAUSE enabled and suspends its simulation when nobody is connected. While paused, gameserver_uptime_seconds stops advancing entirely, so the Server uptime panel flatlines. That is expected, not a stuck exporter. Palworld sets AUTO_PAUSE_ENABLED=false and its API exposes no pause field, so it never appears here.",
